          <div style="margin-left:192pt; margin-top:-12pt; width:264pt; line-height:12pt;">To purchase Shares in the offering, an investor must complete and sign a subscription agreement (in the form attached to this prospectus as Appendix A) for a specific dollar amount equal to or greater than $4,000 for Class A or Class D Shares, and $100,000 for Class I Shares, and pay such amount at the time of subscription. An investor should make his or her check payable to &#8220;NorthStar Real Estate Capital Income Fund.&#8221; Subscriptions will be effective only upon the Trust&#8217;s acceptance and it reserves the right to reject any subscription in whole or in part. Subscriptions will be accepted or rejected by the Trust within 15 days of receipt and, if rejected, all funds will be returned to subscribers without deduction for any expenses within ten business days from the date the subscription is rejected without interest, unless otherwise required by applicable law. Pending acceptance of an </div>
